<title>UK: Norway's Gullfaks Dec loadings flat at 20 cargoes.</title>
<headline>Norway's Gullfaks Dec loadings flat at 20 cargoes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Gullfaks crude system is scheduled to load 20 cargoes in December, unchanged from November, traders said on Friday.</p>
</text>
